2026-07-27T10:46:11.5540338Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:46:11.5540840Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:46:11.5541545Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:46:11.5542593Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:46:11.5543888Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
